          "@id": "sce:fera-2026-03-20-er-eligible",
          "urpx:name": "FERA-eligible residential customer",
          "urpx:description": "Customer must be a residential customer enrolled in the FERA program per Schedule D-FERA eligibility requirements: household income at-or-below 250% of the Federal Poverty Guidelines AND a minimum of three or more persons residing in the household. Customers receiving the CARE Discount are not eligible for FERA simultaneously. Application + eligibility declaration required; SCE applies discount no later than one billing period after approval. Customers may be rebilled for periods when they did not meet eligibility requirements.",
